  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width=40 valign=top style='width:30.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>  2.</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=405 valign=top style='width:303.6pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Preapplication
  conference:  already built construction for commercial use</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=124 valign=top style='width:92.85pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>$5,084.00</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width=40 valign=top style='width:30.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>  3.</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=405 valign=top style='width:303.6pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Preapplication
  conference:  other development type, per county staff participant</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=124 valign=top style='width:92.85pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>$1,271.00</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width=40 valign=top style='width:30.15pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>  4.</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=405 valign=top style='width:303.6pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Cancellation of a
  conference without notification before its scheduled start time or failure to
  attend</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=124 valign=top style='width:92.85pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>$50.00</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.  The total preapplication
conference fee under subsection A. of this section shall be credited against
any required application or permit fees for a subsequent permit application to
address work commenced without permits, but only if the subsequent permit
application is filed within one hundred eighty days of the preapplication
conference or within sixty days of public health department or other agency
approval required for a complete development permit application.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.  The fee for
a zoning certification letter confirming an existing zoning designation or
development rights is four hundred twenty-three dollars.  The fee for zoning
certification requiring historic research or review of other information is one
thousand two hundred seventy-one dollars.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.  A fee of six
hundred thirty-five dollars shall be charged for each inspection of structures
for housing code compliance, damage from flood, storm, fire or other natural
disaster, or for each site visit conducted before permit application.  (Ord. 20021
§ 5 (expired January 1, 2027):  Ord. 19857 § 5, 2024:  Ord. 19529 § 3, 2022: 
Ord. 19195 § 4, 2020:  Ord. 18822 § 9, 2018:  Ord. 18791 § 207, 2018:  Ord.
18385 § 2, 2016:  Ord. 17923 § 7, 2014:  Ord. 17682 § 10, 2013:  Ord. 17453 §
9, 2012:  Ord. 17224 § 16, 2011:  Ord. 16959 § 16, 2010:  Ord. 14683 § 41,
2003:  Ord. 13332 § 4, 1998).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>*Reviser's note:  Sections
2 through 33 of this ordinance expire January 1, 2027.  (Ordinance 20021 § 36).</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

