  letter-spacing:-.1pt'>$690.00 for the first $25,00.00 plus $18.00 for each
  additional $1000.00, or fraction thereof, to $50,000.00</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width=30 valign=top style='width:22.5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
