  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>3.</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=136 valign=top style='width:102.25pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
