  <td width=420 valign=top style='width:315.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
  letter-spacing:-.1pt'>$1,740.00 for the first $100,000.00 plus $10.00 for
