Grading or clearing site plan review (in effect January 1, 2027, and
thereafter*).</b>  Grading or clearing site plan review includes review for
compliance with King County grading and clearing code requirements.  Grading or
clearing site plan review fees shall be charged as follows:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.       Grading
up to 2,000 square feet, or clearing up to 0.2 acre          $849.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.       Grading
between 2,001 square feet and 0.2 acres        $1,484.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.       Grading
or clearing from 0.21 to 1.0 acres                    $3,601.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.       Grading
or clearing from 1.01 to 20.0 acres:  base fee   $2,934.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          E.       Grading
or clearing from 1.01 to 20.0 acres:  fee per acre           $668.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          F.       Grading
or clearing over 20.0 acres                           $16,294.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          G.      Periodic
review of surface mine and material processing facility          Applicable</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                                            fee
in</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                                  subsections</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                                 A.
