<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                               of
this section</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          H.       Forest
practices act - class IV review - residential          $1,484.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          I.        Forest
practices act - class IV review - non residential   $2,968.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          J.       Forest
practices act - release of moratorium, excluding</span></p>

