font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                    shoreline
environment redesignation                            $4,428.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.       Other
zoning reclassification requests including shoreline</span></p>

