font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                    environment
redesignation, deletion of special district overlay,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                    or
amendment or deletion of p-suffix conditions           $18,106.00</span></p>

<p class=Normal style='text-align:justify'>          D.  <span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>If a site-specific amendment is implemented as
part of a Comprehensive Plan update, the application fee will be credited
toward the zoning reclassification fee, but only if the application for zoning
reclassification is filed within one year of the effective date of the
site-specific land use map amendment.  (Ord. 20021 § 20 (in effect until
January 1, 2027):  Ord. 19857 § 18, 2024:  Ord. 19529 § 16, 2022:  Ord. 19195 §
21, 2020:  Ord. 19146 § 89, 2020:  Ord. 18822 § 26, 2018:  Ord. 18385 § 20,
