merger - review                                                    $2,616.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          E.  Concurrent
review of additional applications for contiguous parcels shall be charged fifty
percent of the review fees listed in this section.</span></p>

