font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.       Boundary
line adjustment - basic - review                     $6,271.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.       Boundary
line adjustment - complex - review                $9,660.00</span></p>

