font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                    and
notarized Mylar more than ninety days after approval of</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                    adjustment                                                                    $849.00</span></p>

