<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>*Reviser's note:  Sections
2 through 33 of this ordinance expire January 1, 2027.  (Ordinance 20021 § 36).</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          <b>27.10.310  Construction
and site development inspection - applicability.</b>  Construction and site
development inspection fees shall compensate the department for inspections
necessary to determine compliance with adopted international codes and other
county regulations.  The fees may be based on valuation as defined in this
title, fixed or both based on valuation and fixed.  Fees shall be collected for
reinspections and supplemental inspections, as well as being collected to
compensate the department for inspection of:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.  Commercial
and residential buildings, additions, and under K.C.C. chapters 16.04 and 16.78
and K.C.C. Titles 20 and 21A;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.  Grading and
clearing sites under K.C.C. chapter 16.82;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.  Site
development, including roads and drainage and erosion control under K.C.C.
Titles 9 and 14 and K.C.C. chapter 16.82; </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.  Shoreline
permit approvals and exemptions under K.C.C. Title 25;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          E.  State
Environmental Policy Act condition compliance under K.C.C. chapter 20.48;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          F.  Zoning
condition compliance under K.C.C. Title 21A; and</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>          G.  Monitoring
drainage and sensitive area conditions.  (Ord. 19485 § 210, 2022:  <span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Ord. 17682 § 33, 2013:</span>  Ord. 16959 § 35,
2010:  Ord. 13332 § 39, 1998).</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          <b>27.10.320  Inspection
fees for buildings and structures - valuation - fees - construction
modifications of buildings, structures, and equipment fees (in effect until
January 1, 2027*).</b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.  Except as
otherwise provided in this section, inspection fees for buildings and
structures, including construction, additions, modifications, and equipment, shall
be calculated using valuations published by the International Code Council or
other current nationally recognized standards.  The building official shall
establish the final valuation.  Fees shall be based on the valuation
established under this subsection as follows:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          Valuation                                                                                      Fee</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     $1.00 to $25,000.00                        $183.00
plus $44.60 for each</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        $1,000.00,
or fraction thereof,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                               to
$25,000.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     $25,000.01 to $50,000.00                           $1,298.00
for the first</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                 $25,000.00
plus $30.80</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        for
each additional $1,000.00,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                    or
fraction thereof, to $50,000.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            3.     $50,000.01 to $100,000.00                         $2,068.00
for the first</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                 $50,000.00
plus $21.70</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        for
each additional $1,000.00,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                  or
fraction thereof, to $100,000.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
