<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          <b>27.10.320  Permit
fees for inspection of buildings and other structures - valuation - fees
charged - fees for inspecting permits to construct or modify buildings,
structures, and equipment (in effect January 1, 2027, and thereafter*).</b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.  Except as
otherwise provided in this section, permit fees for the inspection of buildings
and other structures, including additions, modifications, and mechanical
equipment, shall be calculated using valuations published by the International
Code Council or other current nationally recognized standards.  The building
official shall establish the final valuation.  The permit inspection fee
charged shall be based on the valuation established under this subsection as
follows:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          Valuation                                                                                      Fee</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     $1.00 to $25,000.00                        $160.00
plus $39.00 for each</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        $1,000.00,
or fraction thereof,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                               to
$25,000.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     $25,000.01 to $50,000.00                           $1,135.00
for the first</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                 $25,000.00
plus $27.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        for
each additional $1,000.00,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                    or
fraction thereof, to $50,000.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            3.     $50,000.01 to $100,000.00                         $1,810.00
for the first</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                                 $50,000.00
