letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                        for
each additional $1,000.00,</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>                                                                  or
fraction thereof, to $100,000.00</span></p>

