<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          27.10.350  Automatic
sprinkler or fire alarm systems, monitoring transmitter, tank and other system inspections
- conformance with approved plan (in effect until January 1, 2027*).</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'> 
Fees shall be charged for inspections to ensure that projects are constructed
in accordance with approved plans as follows.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.       Automatic sprinkler or fire alarm
systems - new installation or alteration</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     Fee for each device, head, or plug                                    $24.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     Fee for each system or riser                                        $1,160.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.       Monitoring transmitter, each system                                $970.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.       Tank installation, removal, or
abandonment, each            $970.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.       Other system construction or
installation, each system  $1,711.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>(Ord. 20021 § 26 (in
effect until January 1, 2027):  Ord. 19857 § 24, 2024:  Ord. 19529 § 22, 2022: 
Ord. 19195 § 27, 2020:  Ord. 18822 § 32, 2018:  Ord. 18385 § 26, 2016:  Ord.
17923 § 31, 2014:  Ord. 17682 § 36, 2013:  Ord. 17453 § 36, 2012:  Ord. 17224 §
37, 2011:  Ord. 16959 § 38, 2010:  Ord. 15957 § 22, 2007:  Ord. 14683 § 24,
2003:  Ord. 13996 § 9, 2000:  [Ord. 13664 § 10, 1999, repealed by Ord. 13996 §
13, 2000]:  Ord. 13332 § 42, 1998).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>*Reviser's note:  Sections
2 through 33 of this ordinance expire January 1, 2027.  (Ordinance 20021 § 36).</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          27.10.350  Automatic
sprinkler or fire alarm systems, monitoring transmitter, tank and other system inspections
- conformance with approved plan (in effect January 1, 2027, and thereafter*).</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'> 
Fees shall be charged to cover the costs of physical inspections to assure that
projects are constructed in accordance with approved plans as follows.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.       Automatic sprinkler or fire alarm
systems - new installation or alteration</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     Fee for each device, head or plug                                     $21.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     Fee for each system or riser                                        $1,015.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.       Monitoring transmitter, each system                                $849.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.       Tank installation, removal or
abandonment, each             $849.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.       All other system construction or
installation, each system          $1,497.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>(Ord. 20021 § 26 (expired
