<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          27.10.360  Special
event or fireworks display, building occupancy and fire code operational
permits - reviewing applications and inspecting permits (in effect until
January 1, 2027*).</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>   Fees shall be charged for reviewing applications and
inspecting permits for fireworks, special events, building occupancy and fire
code operational permits as follows:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.       Special event or fireworks display</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     Application fee                                                              $483.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     Inspection fee, per site visit                                            $796.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.       Building occupancy inspection, per
building per site visit   $419.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.       Inspection of an operational permit
under the International fire code</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            1.     Initial permit, per code item                                            $171.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            2.     Permit renewal, per code item                                        $114.00</span></p>

